def en_pages():
    P = {}
    P["privacy"] = ("Privacy Policy · Namaz Yolu", "Privacy policy and data protection notice (GDPR / Turkish KVKK) for the Namaz Yolu app and namazyolu.com.", doc("en", "Privacy Policy",
     "<b>In short:</b> Namaz Yolu needs no account. Your prayer tracking, khatm, fasting and settings stay on your phone. Your location is used on the device for prayer times and the qibla. The free version shows ads served by Google AdMob.",
     [("1. Controller and contact", f"<p>The app and site are published on Google Play under the developer account “Göçler Store”. Data controller: {C} (individual developer). Contact: {M}. This page also serves as our notice under the Turkish Personal Data Protection Law (KVKK, Law No. 6698) and the EU/UK GDPR; the Turkish-language <a href=\"{PAGES['kvkk']['tr']}\">KVKK notice</a> is the Turkish original.</p>"),
      ("2. Data that stays on your device", "<p>Settings and theme, chosen location, prayer and qada tracking, fasting calendar, personal khatm, reading plan, dhikr counts, badges and zakat amounts are stored only on your phone and are not sent to us. Uninstalling the app deletes them.</p>"),
      ("3. Location", "<p>With your permission, location is used <b>on the device</b> to calculate prayer times, find the qibla and show the city name. If you use <b>Nearby mosques</b>, your location is rounded to about 100 m and sent to our server (namazyolu.com) and to Overpass (OpenStreetMap) servers. Our server does not link it to you and caches mosque lists for ~11 km areas for 30 days. Without location permission the app works with a city you choose.</p>"),
      ("4. Group khatm", f"<p>If you create or join a group khatm, our server stores its title and intention, the optional name you enter, the juz you take and a random app-generated device ID. People with the same code can see names and juz; the device ID is never shown. To limit abuse we keep a shortened, irreversible hash of your IP address. To delete a khatm or name, see <a href=\"{PAGES['delete']['en']}\">Data Deletion</a>.</p>"),
      ("5. Gold price", "<p>If you tap “Fetch current price” in the zakat calculator, our server receives only your currency (e.g. TRY) and returns the gram-gold price.</p>"),
      ("6. Ads (Google AdMob)", "<p>The free version shows ads through Google AdMob. AdMob may collect advertising ID, device information, approximate location (from IP), ad interactions and diagnostics to serve and measure ads and prevent fraud. Users in the EEA, UK and Switzerland see Google's consent form; you can change your choice under Settings → About → Ad consent preferences. Ads are limited to content suitable for a general audience. See <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites\" rel=\"noopener\">how Google uses data from partner sites and apps</a>. You can reset or delete your advertising ID in your phone settings.</p>"),
      ("7. Website namazyolu.com", f"<p>The site sets no tracking or advertising cookies without your consent. If you accept, Google AdSense uses third-party cookies to serve ads (see the <a href=\"{PAGES['cookies']['en']}\">Cookie Policy</a>). Fonts are served from our own server; no external font service is used. Our hosting provider may keep technical server logs (IP address, browser information, request time) for security.</p>"),
      ("8. Purchases", f"<p>The ad-free Premium purchase is made entirely through Google Play. We never see or store your payment details; the app only learns from Google Play whether a purchase exists. See <a href=\"{PAGES['refunds']['en']}\">Purchases &amp; Refunds</a>.</p>"),
      ("9. Notifications", "<p>Prayer, suhoor/iftar, hadith-of-the-day and reading reminders are scheduled on your phone; nothing is sent to a server for this.</p>"),
      ("10. Quran text, audio and Kaaba stream", "<p>Quran text, translations and recitation audio are downloaded from alquran.cloud / islamic.network, which can see your IP address during these requests. The live Kaaba stream plays via YouTube and is subject to YouTube's privacy policy.</p>"),
      ("11. Legal bases (GDPR) and sharing", "<p>Consent (location permission, ad consent, cookies); performance of a contract (group khatm, Premium); legitimate interests (security, abuse prevention). We do not sell personal data. Recipients are limited to Google, our hosting provider, OpenStreetMap Overpass, alquran.cloud/islamic.network and YouTube. Some are located outside your country (including the USA); transfers rely on your consent for ads and on the safeguards provided by those providers. All connections use HTTPS.</p>"),
      ("12. Retention", "<p>On-device data stays until you delete it. Group khatm records are kept while the khatm is active or until you ask for deletion; long-unused khatms may be deleted. The mosque cache is deleted after 30 days.</p>"),
      ("13. Children", "<p>The app is for a general audience. The children's sections in the ablution and prayer guide are meant for parents teaching their children. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13; tell us and we will delete it.</p>"),
      ("14. Your rights", f"<p>You may request access, correction, deletion, restriction or portability, and object to processing, by writing to {M}. We answer within 30 days. You may also complain to the Turkish Personal Data Protection Authority (kvkk.gov.tr) or your local supervisory authority.</p>"),
      ("15. Changes", "<p>When this policy changes, the new date appears on this page.</p>")]))
    P["cookies"] = ("Cookie Policy · Namaz Yolu", "Cookies used on namazyolu.com and how to manage your choices.", doc("en", "Cookie Policy",
     f"This policy applies only to the <b>namazyolu.com website</b>. For ad consent in the mobile app see the <a href=\"{PAGES['privacy']['en']}\">Privacy Policy</a>.",
     [("1. What are cookies?", "<p>Cookies and similar technologies (such as browser local storage) are small records stored on your device when you visit a site.</p>"),
      ("2. What we use", """<table><tr><th>Name / provider</th><th>Type</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
<tr><td>ny-consent-v1 (local storage), namazyolu.com</td><td>Necessary</td><td>Remember your cookie choice</td><td>Until you delete it</td></tr>
<tr><td>Google AdSense cookies (e.g. __gads, __gpi, IDE), Google</td><td>Advertising (third party)</td><td>Serving, measuring and personalising ads</td><td>Set by Google (typically up to 13 months)</td></tr></table>
<p>We use no analytics cookies. Fonts load from our own server.</p>"""),
      ("3. Your consent", "<p>No cookie other than the necessary record is loaded until you press “Accept”. If you press “Decline”, advertising cookies are not loaded and the site works the same. You can change or withdraw your choice at any time via <b>Cookie preferences</b> in the page footer. Visitors in the EEA, UK and Switzerland may additionally see Google's own consent message.</p>"),
      ("4. Managing in your browser", "<p>You can delete or block cookies in your browser settings. You can turn off personalised ads in <a href=\"https://adssettings.google.com\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Ad Settings</a> or opt out of third-party cookies at <a href=\"https://www.aboutads.info\" rel=\"noopener\">aboutads.info</a>. Google's data use: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites\" rel=\"noopener\">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.</p>"),
      ("5. Contact", f"<p>Questions: {M}.</p>")]))
    P["terms"] = ("Terms of Use · Namaz Yolu", "Terms of use for the Namaz Yolu app and website.", doc("en", "Terms of Use",
     "By using the Namaz Yolu app or namazyolu.com you accept these terms.",
     [("1. Service", f"<p>Namaz Yolu offers prayer times, the Quran, qibla, prayer and fasting tracking, khatm, supplications and image messages. Provider: {C} (“Göçler Store”). Contact: {M}.</p>"),
      ("2. Licence", "<p>You get a non-exclusive, non-transferable right to use the app for personal, non-commercial purposes. You agree not to reverse engineer, copy or redistribute the app, or abuse the service.</p>"),
      ("3. Religious content and accuracy", "<p>Prayer times are calculated from your location and the selected method; in Türkiye the Diyanet method is used. Qibla and times may deviate slightly depending on device sensors, location accuracy and clock settings. For religious rulings please consult qualified authorities and scholars. The app does not issue fatwas.</p>"),
      ("4. Premium (ad-free)", f"<p>Premium removes ads and is bought with a one-time payment through Google Play. The price is shown on the purchase screen. Payment, refunds and restoring purchases follow Google Play's rules. See <a href=\"{PAGES['refunds']['en']}\">Purchases &amp; Refunds</a>.</p>"),
      ("5. Group khatm and user content", "<p>You are responsible for names and intention text you enter in group khatm being lawful and respectful of others. We may remove insulting, hateful, promotional, personal-data or other inappropriate content without notice.</p>"),
      ("6. Image messages and IP", "<p>Designs, images, text and software belong to Namaz Yolu or its licensors. You may share image messages personally (e.g. on WhatsApp); you may not copy or sell them commercially. Quran text and translations are subject to their sources' terms.</p>"),
      ("7. Limitation of liability", "<p>The service is provided “as is” with no guarantee of uninterrupted or error-free operation. Subject to mandatory law, we are not liable for indirect damages (for example a notification delayed by your phone's battery saver). Your statutory consumer rights remain unaffected.</p>"),
      ("8. Changes and termination", "<p>We may update these terms or the service, or end it. Material changes are published here with a new date.</p>"),
      ("9. Governing law", "<p>The laws of the Republic of Türkiye apply. Consumer disputes go to consumer arbitration committees and consumer courts; other disputes to the courts of Türkiye. Mandatory consumer protection of your country of residence remains unaffected.</p>")]))
    P["refunds"] = ("Purchases & Refunds · Namaz Yolu", "Namaz Yolu Premium purchase, refund and withdrawal information.", doc("en", "Purchases & Refunds",
     "Pre-contract information for the Premium (ad-free) purchase.",
     [("1. Seller", f"<p>{C} (“Göçler Store”). Contact: {M}. Sales are made through Google Play; Google collects the payment.</p>"),
      ("2. Product", "<p>Namaz Yolu Premium is a digital product bought with a one-time payment: it removes ads and unlocks additional content. Price and taxes are shown on the purchase screen before you pay.</p>"),
      ("3. Payment and delivery", "<p>You pay with the payment method saved in Google Play; we never receive your card details. The content is activated immediately after purchase.</p>"),
      ("4. Right of withdrawal", "<p>For digital content supplied immediately, the statutory right of withdrawal may not apply once performance has begun with your consent (for example under Turkish distance-selling rules and EU Directive 2011/83/EU). Your confirmation of the purchase counts as that consent. Google Play's refund policy and any mandatory rights you have as a consumer remain unaffected.</p>"),
      ("5. How to request a refund", "<p>Refund requests are made through Google Play (Play Store → Profile → Payments &amp; subscriptions → Budget &amp; history → the purchase → request a refund, or Google Play Help). If you have a problem, write to us with your order number and we will consider every reasonable request.</p>"),
      ("6. Restoring a purchase", "<p>On another device with the same Google account, use “Restore purchase” in the app to re-activate Premium.</p>"),
      ("7. Complaints", "<p>You may send complaints to us and may also contact your local consumer authority or court.</p>")]))
    P["delete"] = ("Data Deletion · Namaz Yolu", "How to delete your Namaz Yolu data.", doc("en", "Data Deletion",
     "Namaz Yolu needs no account, so there is no account to delete; here is how to delete your data.",
     [("1. Data on your phone", "<p>Prayer tracking, khatm, fasting, settings, location choice, dhikr counts and similar data stay only on your phone. To delete: Settings → Apps → Namaz Yolu → Storage → <b>Clear data</b>, or uninstall the app.</p>"),
      ("2. Data on our server", f"""<p>Only if you used <b>group khatm</b> is there a record on our server. To have it deleted, email {M} with:</p>
<ul><li>Subject: “Namaz Yolu data deletion”</li><li>The <b>khatm code</b> (6 characters) and what to delete: the whole khatm or only your name</li><li>Brief proof that you created it or took a juz (e.g. khatm title, intention text, your juz)</li></ul>
<p>We answer within <b>30 days</b>, usually much sooner.</p>"""),
      ("3. Advertising data", "<p>You can reset or delete your advertising ID under Settings → Google → Ads on your phone, and change in-app ad consent under Settings → About → Ad consent preferences.</p>"),
      ("4. Website", "<p>Change your cookie choice via “Cookie preferences” in the footer, or clear your browser data to remove the record.</p>"),
      ("5. Other requests", f"<p>For access, correction or objection requests under GDPR/KVKK, write to {M}. See the <a href=\"{PAGES['privacy']['en']}\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>")]))
